{"candidateAnswer":"The dog park near Audrey's usual walking park","evidence":"[D4:25 | 5:41 pm on 3 May, 2023] Audrey: The hats don't bother them, they just put them on for fun and treats. And the dog park is great place to start! They can run and mingle with other pooches. It's such a fun spot for playdates!\n[D14:2 | 11:05 am on 4 August, 2023] Audrey: That's awesome! That must be fun! I just started agility classes with my pups at a dog park. It's awesome to watch them learn and build relationships with other dogs. Seeing them face and conquer challenges really warms my heart.\n[D23:10 | 4:22 pm on 13 October, 2023] Audrey: The dog park is like paradise for them! They love socializing with the other pups and getting lots of exercise. It's so cute to watch them running around and smelling all the stuff. Do you have any funny stories about your pup at the dog park?","itemId":"urn:uuid:56f9b6db-38d5-59a2-96c6-cc04ff96ed2c","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:0a6b7f6902c9cba3c15e300404e0dc6692059e9fc3d98105ab82ddce4cca5f4b","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What is a good place for dogs to run around freely and meet new friends?","referenceAnswer":"The dog park","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"0a6b7f6902c9cba3c15e300404e0dc6692059e9fc3d98105ab82ddce4cca5f4b"}}]}